scene iso.esn

# The ball closed (two more points than quads), the ring closed round its
# hole (as many); points within a twentieth of the lattice's spacing of
# the ball, normals along its own; the faces facing out, closing nearly
# all the ball's volume (1.437) and the ring's (0.434), cut a little
# where the lattice is coarse beside them.
frame 0.0
